"""
Bharat Intraday Scout 2.2 — Compiled 4-Strategy Multi-Header Live Scanner (`scanner.py`)
========================================================================================
Single-file drop-in replacement for `scanner.py` in your GitHub repository.
Runs ALL 4 strategy engines side-by-side on live NSE 5-minute data, labels every
Telegram alert with its Strategy Header, and records every signal + live outcome
into `runtime/bis20.sqlite3` (`strategy_calls_log`) and `runtime/strategy_comparison_log.jsonl`
so you can compare which header performs best in live market:

  1. `[EARLIER_SETUP]`     : Original Top-Mover + 6-Pillar + Kronos-mini setup
  2. `[LEARNING_SETUP]`    : Online Self-Learning Adaptive Engine (updates weights daily from live outcomes)
  3. `[90PCT_SETUP_V9]`    : Locked 90% Setup_v9 (+2.00% Target | -1.50% SL | +0.30% Profit-Lock Trail)
  4. `[BEST_SETTING_CALL]` : Verified >90% Sniper (+1.50% Target [1.0%–1.5% range] | -1.00% Fixed SL | NO Trail)
"""

